{"files": [{"id": 26230852, "name": "ppat.1009314.g003.tif", "size": 820084, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/26230852", "supplied_md5": "1d3923b2884f246ca1ffc638c6c6b1f7", "computed_md5": "1d3923b2884f246ca1ffc638c6c6b1f7", "mimetype": "image/tiff"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 10053043, "full_name": "Lisa K. McLellan", "first_name": "Lisa K.", "last_name": "McLellan", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 10053046, "full_name": "Michael R. McAllaster", "first_name": "Michael R.", "last_name": "McAllaster", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 8677395, "full_name": "Arthur S. Kim", "first_name": "Arthur S.", "last_name": "Kim", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 5489075, "full_name": "\u013dubom\u00edra T\u00f3thov\u00e1", "first_name": "\u013dubom\u00edra", "last_name": "T\u00f3thov\u00e1", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 10053049, "full_name": "Patrick D. Olson", "first_name": "Patrick D.", "last_name": "Olson", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 267868, "full_name": "Jerome S. Pinkner", "first_name": "Jerome S.", "last_name": "Pinkner", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 9176222, "full_name": "Allyssa L. Daugherty", "first_name": "Allyssa L.", "last_name": "Daugherty", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 9176216, "full_name": "Teri N. Hreha", "first_name": "Teri N.", "last_name": "Hreha", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 1386372, "full_name": "James W. Janetka", "first_name": "James W.", "last_name": "Janetka", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 7538093, "full_name": "Daved H. Fremont", "first_name": "Daved H.", "last_name": "Fremont", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 243893, "full_name": "Scott J. Hultgren", "first_name": "Scott J.", "last_name": "Hultgren", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 10053052, "full_name": "Herbert W. Virgin", "first_name": "Herbert W.", "last_name": "Virgin", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 376449, "full_name": "David A. Hunstad", "first_name": "David A.", "last_name": "Hunstad", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/A_lentiviral_CRISPR_screen_identifies_candidate_type_1_pilus_receptor_desmoglein-2_/13666765", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p><b>A</b>) Schematic of screen design. To screen for host genes responsible for type 1 pili-dependent binding to this cell line, we transduced the Brie library of mouse guide RNAs into IMCD-3 cells bearing Cas9, providing 4\u00d7 nominal coverage of each gene within the mouse genome. Cells were then bound (MOI 150) by UTI89 and sorted by fluorescent labeling, isolating cells unbound by bacteria. Genomic DNA was extracted and sequenced, identifying candidate genes that may be required for UPEC binding to IMCD-3 cells. <b>B</b>) Volcano plot results from sorted and sequenced cells. Colored dots represent genes having an average log<sub>2</sub> fold change >0.5 and a\u2013log<sub>10</sub>(p-value) >2.5. <b>C</b>) After <i>in vitro</i> binding, desmoglein-2 (red) on IMCD-3 cells co-localized with UPEC (green); scale bar, 5 \u03bcm. Lower panel demonstrates co-localization in orthogonal view of z-stack projection.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 820084, "created_date": "2021-01-29T18:42:53Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-05T10:49:53Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["FimH mannose-binding pocket", "type 1 pilus-mediated pathogenesis", "